{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_clour_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_clour_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "安身之处",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_clour_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c3b5260680ba967b0a4682e63c0c6a724d8dff6a98d61f916df0406854adb638",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "11:00 A.M. 天气/晴朗\n罗德岛宿舍"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "厚重的真皮毛毡严实地遮住窗户，一簇烛火堪堪将房间照亮。\n矮小的沃尔珀少女张弓搭箭，警惕地注视着前方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是终端在响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真吵......是这么用的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红云......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，哪去了......抱歉红云，稍等一下哦。奇怪，明明放进工具箱里了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔！在这里！怎么被塞到配件盒里了。久等了——芙蓉？怎么是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安德切尔，你看见红云了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还想问你呢，红云刚刚还在这里的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我为她调整了义肢，想给她拿一份甜品来着。不过一下的工夫，她就不见了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安德切尔，你知道她接下来可能会去什么地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没问。最近她不是在休假吗，去哪里都有可能吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉，你看起来很慌张......难道红云出什么事了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红云......今天是她定期接受矿石病治疗的日子，但是下午她没来医疗部，而且取消了所有治疗预约。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得知消息以后我找到她的宿舍，发现她不在里面，房间里似乎少了不少东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我问了一圈，谁都不知道她去哪里了，有见到她的人说她在闷头走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不会吧，她来我这里时，也没表现得特别奇怪。不过说起来，的确有个不太寻常的举动......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是在调整完之后，她突然不由分说地塞给我一份礼物。以前她不会这样的，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她给了你什么，能给我看看吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "speakerId": "char_211_adnach",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喏，就是这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兽牙吊饰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "对了芙蓉，既然你都来了，要不要尝尝我做的甜品——\n欸，别急着走啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉！下次一定！我得先去找红云问个明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莉娜，你的黑眼圈好严重哦。最近没有休息好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事啦，就是前段时间加班比较多。你知道这段时间做完外勤任务回来的干员很多嘛，医疗部这边就一下子忙起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过这也正常啦，很多前辈比我们加班更严重，忙过这阵就清闲多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（停步）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医疗部的工作是这样啦，紧一阵松一阵的。不用担心，我马上就回去补觉——哇啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红云？你什么时候在这里的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你拖着这么多东西是要去哪里呀？回家吗？还是去多索雷斯度假？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不回家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请问你们知道罗德岛上哪里有药草吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，你有哪里不舒服吗？我可以先帮你检查一下，或者我陪你去医疗部......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有，我只是想知道哪里有药草。你们知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起药草，听说莱娜小姐在疗养庭院里栽种了各种各样的花草，也许其中有一些会有药用价值......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢，我现在就去找她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，这个给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抛光的骨片......给我这个做什么呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来啦来啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "波登可，这么晚就不用拿订单过来......咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莱娜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小红云......啊，请进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，因为平时你都在出外勤，我没怎么在休息区域见过你，突然见到你来找我，实在有些意外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什么我可以帮到你的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想要几种药草，你这儿有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是想要有药用价值的植物吗？当然可以，告诉我名字就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不知道它们的名字，但见到它们，我就能认出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，那你随我来庭院看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有见到你要的植物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个，这个，还有那个开红色小花的草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（都是一些有舒缓安神功效的花卉......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还要别的吗......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这里有那种......叶子上有很多小疙瘩的草吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叶子上有很多小疙瘩的草？哦，是说石麻草吗？它有调节情绪的作用，我就在庭院种了一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "脖子割破了，把它们嚼碎塞进伤口里，就不会感觉到痛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那种藤韧性很好，可以绞断骨头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......小红云，先不说这个，你还需要别的植物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "够了，不用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给，都装在盒子里啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些药草很有价值，我得想想要用什么和你换。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "换？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弓不能给你，手也不能给你......我身上其他有价值的东西，只剩这柄匕首了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用啦，你拿去就好，这不过是一些花花草草，在庭院里还有不少呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行。一份猎物换一份报酬，一趟出差换一顿晚饭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一把匕首......换莱娜的药草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小红云，我不需要你这么做。发生了什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是匕首不够吗？那我再找找还有什么可以给你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是这个意思，这是一柄很好的匕首......呃，我想，也许平时在园艺中也用得到......唉，我会收下匕首的，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是听好了，之后你千万不要再给别人塞东西了呀！绝对不要了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "药草我带走了，谢谢你......再见，莱娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，小红云。我有一个问题，你......拿这些植物是要做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莱娜，我还不想离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是事情的全部经过......等我追出门去的时候，她已经走得没影了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢......呼，看来得去其他地方找找了。假如接下来是要处理药草的话，实验室可能会是她的去处......我现在就去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉，小红云话里的意思......她是要离开罗德岛了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人事部没有收到她离职的申请。她在外勤任务中的表现也很出色，不可能过不了试用期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之......她的情况我也是一头雾水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "调香师",
      "speakerId": "avg_181_flower_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我更担心的是，送葬人先生带她回来的时候，是不是交代过，她家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莱娜，你放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管是什么促使她做出了任何决定，在从她口中得到真相前，我不会让她离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在不能进去了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，现在后厨已经关门了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "厨具，哪里还有厨具......似乎在谁的办公室见过泡面碗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请留步。看你的样子，你是要出外勤吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天哪，饿着肚子一定不方便赶路吧......我屋子里还有一些干粮和沙虫干，我这就去给你拿来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以麻烦你帮我在这里看着吗？由于时常有人半夜闯入食堂后厨，我被派来负责今晚的安保工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜托了！我很快就回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来后厨是可以进去的，明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好结实的铁门，这是......防护网吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像为阻挡凶恶野兽而设计的，不愧是罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有工作人员的工牌就进不去，有别的办法吗......嗯，这下面有隐蔽锁孔，应该能撬开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可......我的匕首，交给莱娜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "♪哼......哼哼......哼......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？不是酒吧，这里是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......听歌听得太入迷了，竟然走到食堂来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "必须赶紧回去，不然会错过酒吧关门前最后的炸鳞薯条供应......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么人——嗯？红云？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘘......霜叶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红云，你来这儿干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咕——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有带刀吗？能不能借我用一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢，现在我身上没有什么有价值的东西了。我会想办法给你回报的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，你在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "切断这里的电线。然后只要把刀插入锁孔里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是从哪里学到这些技巧的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乌萨斯的佣兵驻地，多试几次就会了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不对！你是在撬后厨的门吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，因为厨具放在里面......我得进去拿到它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你得赶快停下，要是被人看到，会把你当成小偷的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，食堂平时的后勤同事怎么都不在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到锁芯了，接下来只要这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，门开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我回来啦——红云？你在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "工作人员回来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红云，快离开这里——你怎么进去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一口锅找到了，第二口锅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？有人在后厨吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再拿块兽肉好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红云！快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，呼......没人追上来吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有......霜叶，你扛着肉跑得很快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不认为这是什么值得骄傲的事......等等！你又在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这里真的可以生火吗？不会触发警报吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不会，我经常来这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......总之，我得走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒吧已经关门了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我拿了两口锅。这口，煮药草。那口，做炖肉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炖肉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你帮了我，炖肉给你作回报，够不够？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回报？我那根本不算帮你，而且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交换，这是规矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......以前在哥伦比亚我见过一些荒野居民的聚落，聚落的猎人们拿自己狩猎到的猎物向族人换取生活用品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们恪守着这样的规矩，而后走进荒野，日复一日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很熟悉，就像我过去的生活......在很久以前，在我被人带上罗德岛之前，是比那之前更久的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是被人带来罗德岛的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他说是为了给我治病，我的医疗账单已经付清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他看起来并不像坏人，但......也和好不沾边。我不相信他，世上不该有这样的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以和博士谈谈，博士是个好人。看起来也像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说过了，就是那个什么，博士。我说，我不需要他们和我分享任何东西。我为他们工作，以换得我在这里的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士什么都没说，应该是默认了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......罗德岛不是这样的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不用骗我，我去过荒野之外的地方，乌萨斯人的营地、外面的聚落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里的确不用猎物来换东西，但是会用一些闪亮亮的金属片代替亲手取来的收获。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到哪里都是一样，我看得够多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，水开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把水倒进肉里......剩下的水煮药草，盖上盖子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样就好了，再等一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沃尔珀少女习惯性地在墙面上蹭了蹭手，然后在平台的边缘蹲下。她怔怔地望向外面。\n罗德岛正在大地上行驶着，强烈的射灯光芒下，能清晰地看见沿途的碎石被碾作齑粉。\n一阵风掠过荒野，随后连微尘也无影无踪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这里坐着......不会有人来打扰，可以坐很久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛是个好地方，好的外面聚落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不是我的聚落......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霜叶望着前方那矮小的背影，轻轻地叹了口气。\n突然，她快步走向那个背影，同时将耳机靠近红云。\n下一瞬间，乐声在红云的耳畔流淌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "♪无需你的给予，无需你的许诺♪\n♪就在一成不变的太阳下♪\n♪牵起我的手，踏上旅途♪\n♪直到地平线的那头♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这首歌......让我想起从前和族人在一起的时候，吃饭前分餐具，大家边拍桌子边唱的歌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你分享给我，我会想办法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌声的价值是没办法衡量的，也就不能用来交换。这样的事......还有很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样吗......如果没能留下来，在离开的路上，我会好好想想你的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "离开？你要走了？去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能待在罗德岛了，他们不允许......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。天快要亮了。我得抓紧去做最后一次努力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好烦，因为熬了太多的夜，晚上反而睡不着了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么走廊上会有烧木柴的味道......嘶，好香......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是红云吗......还有霜叶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们被发现了。红云？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不见了......锅也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "speakerId": "avg_193_frostl_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是的，那孩子到底跑到什么地方去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跑到食堂以后就没影了，到处都找不见她......前半夜的食堂后厨入侵事件不会和她有关系吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对，能和这种事扯上关系的人也太多了，怎么都算不到红云头上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，肚子好饿......光顾着找人，竟然忘记吃晚饭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "办公室里嘉维尔藏起来的吃的是不是还剩一些，虽然不那么健康但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只吃里面的蔬菜应该......还好？总要有力气找人嘛。嘉维尔一定不会介意的，嗯，大概......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（从办公室那边传来的声音？有人在加班吗......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，有人在办公室吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红云！你竟然在这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉，你在加班吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你去哪里了？我一直在找你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你为什么取消今天的治疗？你说你要离开罗德岛又是怎么回事？你身上的矿石病只是暂时抑制住了，离好转还差得远呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我告诉你，你要是不能交代清楚，就别想从我眼前溜走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不会是......有什么坏人欺负你了吧？不要怕，你告诉我，我会要他好看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生，我有东西要给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "东西？给我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这口锅......像在食堂见过......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要揭开锅盖吗？里面是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们说最近医疗部的工作很忙，你肯定没有睡好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前我追猎物的时候，也有好几天都睡不了觉。有几种药草放在一起煮成的汤，喝下去以后会很舒服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我给你煮了一份，你喝下去，如果感觉到舒服一些，就代表我能帮到你了。这件事我可以一直做下去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我是不是就......还可以留在罗德岛上接受治疗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（揭开盖子）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇......好香。是炖肉吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是这个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，一定、一定是我把锅拿错了！芙蓉，我现在就去换回来！等等我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下......你是在这里专门等着我吗？等着把这个东西给我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道你今天消失一天是为了这个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可这不是我想给你的东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你为什么说要给我那个......草药汤，你才能接受治疗呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为我的工作没有了。我想要留在这里，继续接受治疗，就要找到新的工作。我会做的事不多......只有这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在说什么呀？我专门向人事部确认过，你通过试用期的审批马上就要下来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是昨天早上有人事部的人联系我，说我不用参加外勤任务了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后我在终端上看到，我今天的、明天的，还有下个星期的外勤申请都被取消了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们不允许我留在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......红云，你完全理解错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "理解......错了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人事部会取消你的外勤申请......是因为现在是你的假期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自入职以来连续出了太多的外勤任务！我担心你的身体负荷太重，让医疗部特别为你申请了假期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假期时间，正是从昨天早上开始！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假期......意思是我不用工作，也可以就这样接受治疗吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好傻哦。你出了那么多外勤任务，为大家做了那么多事情，还不算是我们中的一员吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是你们中的一员......你是这么想的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然呀，所以在这里你完全不用计较要还给每个人多少东西，没人会计较这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在是你的假期，你可以凭你自己的心愿，做任何你想做的事。而我们，肯定也会一如既往地支持你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛是你可以安心待着的地方，它正是为此而存在的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你听明白了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没明白也没关系！总之真相搞清楚了，呼，一下子就感觉轻松多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊炖肉！快，找个地方把锅放下！既然是你给我做的，尝几块应该也不要紧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉，罗德岛对你来说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给，餐具拿着。我们赶紧一起吃。你多吃点！要在他们赶来上班之前吃光......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_120_hibisc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你刚刚有问我什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，什么也没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "五天后，红云假期的最后一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早上好，红云。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红云",
      "speakerId": "avg_190_clour_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早上好，莉娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_501_1",
      "isRemote": false,
